# Project Conventions

- Git identity: Jose <jose@nobul.tech>
- Write meaningful commit messages in imperative mood

## Code Style

- Prefer standard library over third-party dependencies when reasonable
- Use type annotations (Python type hints, TypeScript types)
- Keep code simple and readable — avoid premature abstraction

## Cross-Platform Awareness

Both machines are used for development:
- **Windows 11** — PowerShell, Git Bash, `G:\My Drive\` for Google Drive
- **macOS** — zsh/bash, `~/Google Drive/My Drive/` for Google Drive

When writing paths or scripts, consider both platforms unless the project is platform-specific.
